# ---- Generated place database ----
# The read-only place database is a build product of Tools/placedb.
# The pipeline and the curated input are tracked; the downloaded sources and the
# compiled SQLite file are not.
# The database the app bundles is a copy of that build product, so it is not
# committed either — run scripts/build-placedb.sh before the first app build.
Tools/placedb/out/
# Downloaded open data: GeoNames, Natural Earth, OurAirports and the cached Wikidata
# answers, plus the manifest recording each one's digest. Tens of megabytes, and
# re-fetchable with scripts/fetch-placedb-sources.sh.
Tools/placedb/vendor/
App/Antipodes/Resources/places.sqlite
# The globe's country outlines are a build product of Tools/placedb/build_borders.py
# in the same way — run scripts/fetch-borders.sh then scripts/build-borders.sh.
*.antborders
*.sqlite
*.sqlite-journal
*.sqlite-wal
*.sqlite-shm

